    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>BODYCAM</strong> <strong>1997</strong></i> is a first-person shooter horror combined with\u00a0psychological and atmospheric elements.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Key Features:</i></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Terrifying Atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paranormal Creatures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different types of Weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental Storytelling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive Ambience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different types of Enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Around 2-3 hours of Gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liminal Spaces</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse a place where memories rot, machinery still breathes and escape is the only option.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No one remembers the arrival clearly. Not even the protagonist. There was no descent.<br>No crash, nor a warning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just waking. A waking into something too abandoned, too raw and empty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for the unforeseen consequences... and well also</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >sometimes you may be left wondering, who is the benefactor?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed by a one man studio from Croatia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<i>Induction Studio</i></strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>BODYCAM</strong> <strong>1997</strong></i> is a first-person shooter horror combined with\u00a0psychological and atmospheric elements.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Key Features:</i></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Terrifying Atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paranormal Creatures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different types of Weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental Storytelling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive Ambience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different types of Enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Around 2-3 hours of Gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liminal Spaces</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse a place where memories rot, machinery still breathes and escape is the only option.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No one remembers the arrival clearly. Not even the protagonist. There was no descent.<br>No crash, nor a warning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just waking. A waking into something too abandoned, too raw and empty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for the unforeseen consequences... and well also</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >sometimes you may be left wondering, who is the benefactor?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed by a one man studio from Croatia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<i>Induction Studio</i></strong></p>",
